return {
    ["1、每周根据俱乐部神选积分排名，会长可授予一定数量的俱乐部成员为征服先锋；\n2、被授予征服先锋的玩家，将获得道具“征服之证”。"] = "1. Every week, based on the Club's Divine Selection ranking, the President can grant a certain number of Club members the title of Conquest Vanguard; \n2. Players granted the title of Conquest Vanguard will receive the item \"Proof of Conquest\".",
    ["1）本游戏是一款角色扮演类游戏，适用于年满16周岁及以上的用户，建议未成年人在家长监护下使用游戏产品。\n2）本游戏基于架空历史的背景，有适度积极美好的想象和虚构，但不会与现实生活相混淆。游戏玩法基于肢体操作，包含多种多样的玩法，包括角色养成、世界探索、个人挑战等，鼓励玩家提升和挑战自我。游戏中有基于文字和语音的陌生人社交系统，社交系统的管理遵循相关法律法规。\n3）根据国家相关要求，游戏中有用户实名认证系统，未通过实名认证的用户不可进入游戏。认证为未成年人的玩家可在周五、周六、周日和法定节假日每日晚20时至21时登录游戏，其他时间无法登录游戏。\n游戏中部分玩法和道具需要付费。未满8周岁的用户不能付费；8周岁以上未满16周岁的未成年人用户，单次充值金额不得超过50元人民币，每月充值金额累计不得超过200元人民币；16周岁以上的未成年人用户，单次充值金额不得超过100元人民币，每月充值金额累计不得超过400元人民币。\n4）游戏设有组队模式，并设有大型团队任务和比赛，需要玩家互相配合完成比赛，有助于培养玩家的团队协作能力。 游戏提供了丰富的社交系统，包括好友、公会等，玩家间可以互相交流配合，合作完成任务，有助于促进玩家的社会交流，维持良好的社群关系。游戏玩法具有较强的策略性，有助于锻炼玩家的思维能力。"] = "1) This game is a role-playing game suitable for users aged 16 and above. Minors are advised to use this game product under parental supervision. \n 2) This game is based on an alternate history setting with moderate positive and beautiful imagination and fiction, but it will not be confused with real life. The gameplay is based on physical operations and includes a variety of modes, including character development, world exploration, and personal challenges, encouraging players to improve and challenge themselves. The game features a text and voice-based social system for strangers, and the management of the social system follows relevant laws and regulations. \n 3) According to relevant national requirements, the game has a user real-name authentication system. Users who have not passed real-name authentication cannot enter the game. Players certified as minors can log in to the game from 20:00 to 21:00 on Fridays, Saturdays, Sundays, and statutory holidays; they cannot log in at other times. \n Some gameplay and items in the game require payment. Users under 8 years old cannot make payments; minor users aged 8 to under 16 cannot exceed 50 RMB per single top-up, and the cumulative monthly top-up amount cannot exceed 200 RMB; minor users aged 16 and above cannot exceed 100 RMB per single top-up, and the cumulative monthly top-up amount cannot exceed 400 RMB. \n 4) The game features a team mode, as well as large-scale team quests and competitions, requiring players to cooperate with each other to complete them, which helps cultivate players' teamwork skills. The game provides a rich social system, including friends, guilds, etc., where players can communicate and cooperate with each other to complete tasks, which helps promote social interaction among players and maintain good community relationships. The gameplay is highly strategic, which helps exercise players' thinking skills.",
