    ["　　新生者，再次新生。\n　　这是他的第二十次噩梦，他已经在梦中死去十九次。\n　　这一次，他翻开了不该出现在此地的安提哥努斯笔记，死于污染后的失控。\n　　新生者，再次新生。\n　　这是他的第二十一次新生，他路过安提哥努斯笔记，带走了一张⬛⬛牌。\n　　……\n　　……\n　　新生者来到了开满鲜花的祭坛旁，他/她必须做点什么，他/她的内心有搞清楚一切真相的渴求。\n　　他/她观察了祭坛，获得了一张记载着滑稽言语的羊皮纸。\n　　羊皮纸上记录着一首规则之书。”"] = "The newborn, born again. \n This is his twentieth nightmare; he has already died nineteen times in his dreams. \n This time, he opened the Antigonus Notebook that shouldn't have appeared here and died from loss of control after corruption. \n The newborn, born again. \n This is his twenty-first rebirth; he passed by the Antigonus Notebook and took away a ⬛⬛ card. \n ... \n ... \n The newborn came to the altar full of flowers; he/she must do something. He/she has a desire to figure out the whole truth. \n He/she observed the altar and obtained a piece of parchment recording funny words. \n The parchment records a \"Book of Rules.\"",
